<section id="home" class="relative min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-[#0a0a0a] via-[#111111] to-[#0a0a0a]"></div>

  <div class="parallax-bg absolute inset-0 opacity-20">
    <div class="absolute top-[10%] left-[15%] w-72 h-72 bg-[#a3a3a3]/10 rounded-full blur-[120px]"></div>
    <div class="absolute bottom-[20%] right-[10%] w-96 h-96 bg-[#a3a3a3]/5 rounded-full blur-[150px]"></div>
    <div class="absolute top-[50%] left-[50%] w-64 h-64 bg-[#a3a3a3]/8 rounded-full blur-[100px] -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="grid-lines absolute inset-0 opacity-[0.03]">
    <div class="absolute inset-0" style="background-image: linear-gradient(#a3a3a3 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(90deg, #a3a3a3 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 80px 80px;"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="relative z-10 max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 flex flex-col-reverse lg:flex-row items-center gap-16 lg:gap-24 pt-24">
    <div class="text-center lg:text-left flex-1">
      <p class="text-sm font-mono text-[#a3a3a3] tracking-[0.3em] uppercase mb-4 reveal">Welcome to my portfolio</p>

      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-7xl font-black leading-[0.9] mb-6 reveal">
        Hi, I'm <span class="text-[#a3a3a3] drop-shadow-[0_0_40px_#a3a3a366]">Hilmi</span>
      </h1>

      <h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl lg:text-3xl text-[#a3a3a3] font-light mb-8 reveal">
        I'm a <span class="text-[#a3a3a3] font-semibold" id="typing-text"></span><span class="text-[#a3a3a3] animate-pulse">|</span>
      </h3>

      <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-[#a3a3a3] max-w-xl leading-relaxed mb-10 reveal">
        Suka mengubah ide jadi kenyataan di dunia digital. Dengan skill di teknologi dan desain, aku bikin sesuatu yang berfungsi dan berkesan.
      </p>

